[6834]="7004148D\n1\tTalk to Erchar\tErchar can be found in Linhir. The Corsairs and Haradrim are attacking Linhir. You should speak to Erchar and defend the city.\n2\tListen to the captain's report\tThe captain can be found in Linhir. Erchar is speaking with one of his captains. You should listen to the captain's report.\n3\tDefend Linhir with Erchar\tErchar can be found in Linhir. Erchar is fighting against the invaders in Linhir. You should aid him.\n4\tTalk to Erchar\tErchar can be found in Linhir. You have broken the first assault and should now speak to Erchar.\n5\tAid Erchar in searching for Herion in Linhir\tErchar can be found in Linhir. Erchar is searching for Herion in Linhir. You should follow him.\n6\tTalk to Herion\tHerion can be found in central Linhir, overlooking the Gilrain. You have found Herion amidst the battle and should now speak to him.\n7\tFight through Linhir with Erchar and Herion to aid Garvir\tErchar and Herion can be found in central Linhir. Erchar and Herion are fighting their way through Linhir to reach Garvir.\n8\tAid Garvir and defeat the invaders from Lebennin\tGarvir can be found on the ledge above the Gilrain. You have found Garvir and should aid him before defeating the invaders.\n9\tDefeat the Haradrim war-master and his men\tThe Haradrim war-master can be found near the ledge overlooking the Gilrain. Garvir has been killed by one of the Heirs of Castamir, who called his forces away. You should defeat the remaining men.\n10\tTalk to Erchar\tErchar can be found in central Linhir. You have defeated the invaders and beaten back the attack, but at great cost. You should speak to Erchar.\n",
[6835]="7005A7FD\n1\tTalk to Thromur\tThromur can be found at Amdân. You have accompanied Thromur to confront Shálun. You should talk to Thromur.\n2\tThromur can be found at Amdân. You should follow Thromur and confront Shálun.\t\n3\tTalk to Thromur\tThromur can be found at Amdân. Shálun insists that he played a vital role in Frerin's defeat of Urro at Mount Gundabad. You should talk to Thromur.\n4\tTalk to Shálun\tShálun can be found at Amdân. Shálun insists that he played a vital role in Frerin's defeat of Urro at Mount Gundabad. You should talk to Shálun.\n5\tListen to Thromur and Shálun\tThromur and Shálun can be found at Amdân. Shálun has told his tale of the defeat of Urro at Mount Gundabad, but Thromur has suddenly interjected. You should listen to Thromur and Shálun.\n6\tAgree with Thromur and try to convince Shálun to relinquish Urro's hand\tThromur can be found at Amdân. You should offer your reassurance to Thromur by agreeing about the symbolic importance of Urro's hand to Frerin and Durin's Folk.\n7\tAgree with Thromur and try to convince Shálun to relinquish Urro's hand\tShálun can be found at Amdân. You should try to convince Shálun of the symbolic importance of Urro's hand to Frerin and Durin's Folk.\n8\tTalk to Shálun\tShálun can be found at Amdân. To your surprise, Shálun has produced Urro's hand. You should talk to Shálun.\n9\tFollow Shálun and deliver Urro's hand to Frerin\tShálun can be found at Amdân. You should travel with Shálun to deliver Urro's hand to Frerin.\n10\tTalk to Shálun\tShálun can be found at Azanulbizar. You have arrived to discover King Thráin's vanguard beset by Orcs. You should talk to Shálun.\n11\tFight through the forest and search for Frerin\tThromur and Shálun have arrived at the woods to the north-west of Durin's Stone to aid the vanguard, but they are in retreat! You should fight through the forest and aid the vanguard as you continue the search for Frerin.\n12\tExamine the corpse of Fundin\030Investigate the source of the glint\tThe glint can be found in the woods to the north-west of Durin's Stone. Shálun noticed a glint in the dark of the woods of Azanulbizar. You should investigate its source.\n13\tListen to Thromur and Shálun\tAfter finding the corpse of Fundin, Thromur and Shálun are discussing what is to be done.\n14\tTalk to Thromur\tThromur can be found in the woods to the north-west of Durin's Stone. After pondering what to do next, Thromur has beckoned you over. You should talk to Thromur.\n15\tFollow Thromur and find what remains of King Thráin's vanguard\tYou should search for what remains of King Thráin's vanguard.\n16\tTalk to Shálun\tShálun can be found at Durin's Stone. You have arrived to find King Thráin's vanguard in dire need of aid. The King is wounded and Frerin was slain by Urro One-hand.\n17\tFollow Shálun and aid Thorin\tShálun can be found at Durin's Stone. You should follow Shálun and aid Thorin.\n18\tTalk to Thorin\tThorin can be found at Durin's Stone. Thorin has been wounded by Urro One-hand and lays injured. You should talk to Thorin and aid him if you might.\n19\tFollow Thorin and aid Shálun in defeating Urro One-hand\tThorin can be found at Durin's Stone. You should follow Thorin and aid Shálun in defeating Urro One-hand.\n20\tDefeat Urro One-hand\tUrro One-hand can be found at Durin's Stone. Urro has mortally wounded Shálun. You should aid Thorin in defeating Urro One-hand.\n21\tTalk to Thorin\tThorin can be found at Durin's Stone. You have aided Thorin in defeating Urro One-hand. You should talk to Thorin quickly before tending to Shálun.\n22\tTalk to Shálun\tShálun can be found at Durin's Stone. Shálun aided Thorin, but was dealt a fatal blow by Urro One-hand. You should talk to Shálun.\n",
[6836]="7004A1D1\n1\tMake your way towards Borangos' inner sanctum in Nargroth\tMake your way towards Borangos' inner sanctum in Nargroth.\n2\tFind a suitable place to hide\tFind a suitable place to hide.\n3\tStay hidden and let events transpire\tStay hidden and let events transpire. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[6837]="700599EE\n1\tTalk to Durin outside the gates of Gundabad\tDurin wishes to observe the progress made by the dwarves of the Gabil'akkâ outside the gates of Gundabad.\n2\tTalk to Bósi, former leader of the Iron Garrison\030Talk to Stóthkell, forge-master of the Iron Garrison\030Talk to Venko of the Zhélruka\030Talk to Imák the Stout-axe\tDwarves of the Gabil'akkâ work to break through the ice that blocks passage into Gundabad.\n3\tTalk to Prince Ingór at the ice outside Gundabad\tPrince Ingór desires to wield a sword, not a pick-axe, in service of the effort to gain entrance to Gundabad. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n4\tTalk to Durin\tRúvaran's forces have been routed, and now Durin is eager to return to the work of breaking through the ice before Gundabad.\n5\tFollow Durin\tDurin is eager to pass beyond the ice and into Gundabad.\n6\tTalk to Durin on the landing outside Gundabad\tDurin stands on the landing before the gates of Gundabad, eager to pass into the Mountain-home.\n7\tClimb the stairs and pass through the gates into Gundabad\tThe gates of Gundabad lie before you, atop the stairs.\n8\tTalk to Durin inside Gundabad\tAt long last, Durin has entered the Mountain-home.\n",
[6838]="7003E234\n1\tDefeat Pakon, the Maldorr Orc-chieftain\tThe Boar-tribe chieftain is somewhere within their lair. If you encounter the chieftain of the Boar-tribe, defeat him.\n",
[6839]="7004D3DA\n1\tExamine the corpse of Bregmor\tExamine the corpse of Bregmor.\n2\tExamine the rust spot\tExamine the rust spot.\n3\tExperience the vision\tExperience the vision.\n",
[6840]="7000075F\n1\tDefeat Tarkrîp Chieftain\030Defeat brigands at the Brigand Cave (total: 8)\tDefeat the brigands and Orcs in the cave.\n",
[6841]="70044D55\n1\tTalk to Robbo Gristback\tRobbo Gristback can be found behind the stage in the Blue Theatre. You have arrived at the Blue Theatre and should now help the Cloudyheads prepare for their performance.\n2\tVarious outfits can be found in the halls behind the stage inside the Blue Theatre. Robbo mentioned seeing an outfit in the halls behind the stage. You should search for the most ornate one you can find.\t\n3\tDeliver the outfit to Polla Stoutley\tPolla Stoutley can be found behind the stage in the Blue Theatre. You have found the outfit Robbo described and should now bring it to Polla.\n4\tDance for the audience\030Stand at the front of the stage in the Blue Theatre\tThe stage can be reached by passing through the short halls behind the stage in the Blue Theatre. Polla has asked you to stall for time as the Cloudyheads finish preparing for their performance. You should try the things she suggested to keep the audience entertained.\n5\tTell a story to the audience\030Stand at the front of the stage in the Blue Theatre\tThe stage can be reached by passing through the short halls behind the stage in the Blue Theatre. Polla has asked you to stall for time as the Cloudyheads finish preparing for their performance. You should try the things she suggested to keep the audience entertained.\n6\tPerform a handstand for the audience\030Stand at the front of the stage in the Blue Theatre\tThe stage can be reached by passing through the short halls behind the stage in the Blue Theatre. Polla has asked you to stall for time as the Cloudyheads finish preparing for their performance. You should try the things she suggested to keep the audience entertained.\n7\tTalk to Polla Stoutley\tPolla Stoutley can be found behind the stage inside the Blue Theatre. You have tried to keep the audience entertained with varying degrees of success and should now return to Polla.\n8\tWatch the Cloudyheads perform in the Blue Theatre\tThe Cloudyheads are on stage in the Blue Theatre. The Cloudyheads are performing, so you should enjoy the show!\n9\tTalk to Polla Stoutley\tPolla Stoutley can be found on the stage in the Blue Theatre. You have watched the Cloudyheads' performance and should now congratulate Polla and the others.\n",
[6842]="700466B7\n1\tTalk to Mincham on the rocky slope\tMincham is ahead of you on the rocky slope.\n2\tTalk to Faeron on the rocky slope\tFaeron has returned from scouting the ridge.\n3\tFollow Faeron to Narchost\tEager to learn the Enemy's secrets to help Aragorn and the Host of the West, Faeron wants to enter Narchost.\n4\tEnter Narchost and remain alert\tThe entrance to Narchost is temporarily unguarded.\n5\tTalk to Faeron inside Narchost\tYou have entered Narchost and do not have long before the Orc patrol returns.\n6\tYou have entered Narchost and do not have long before the Orc patrol returns.\t\n7\tMake your way to the upper levels of Narchost. Do not be seen by any of your foes!\tYou have entered Narchost and do not have long before the Orc patrol returns.\n8\tTalk to Mincham inside Narchost\tYou have entered Narchost and do not have long before the Orc patrol returns.\n9\tEavesdrop on the conversation without being seen\tYou have entered Narchost and do not have long before the Orc patrol returns.\n10\tTalk to Faeron inside Narchost\tYou have overheard a conversation between Khôgath the Render and his minion Fulak, but it is not safe to linger within Narchost.\n",
[6843]="7006E4BF\n1\tTalk to Glorfindel on the slope that rises to Kûgrun\tGlorfindel has spotted enemies ahead.\n2\tTalk to Inkanûsh outside the entrance to Cúridwan's home of Kûgrun\tInkanûsh stands outside the entrance to Cúridwan's home of Kûgrun.\n3\tPass through the vines and enter Kûgrun\tThe disturbed vines reveal that some of the Orcs have already entered Kûgrun.\n4\tDefeat all the Orcs and jackals threatening Kûgrun\tOrcs and jackals have come to threaten Cúridwan, and must be cleared from Kûgrun.\n5\tTalk to the one who hid from the Orcs behind Cúridwan's dwelling\tSomeone hid from the Orcs behind Cúridwan's dwelling.\n6\tLearn from Usakâr what has happened to Cúridwan\tInkanûsh and Glorfindel have come to Kûgrun in search of Cúridwan.\n7\tTalk to Usakâr the Hermit in Kûgrun\tUsakâr the Hermit may know what happened to Cúridwan.\n8\tListen to the conversation in Kûgrun\tListen to the conversation between the Wizard, the Elf, and the hermit in Kûgrun.\n",
[6844]="70033831\n1\tDisable the forge\tHigh above Hurmulkezer, the ancient forge has been claimed by the Orcs.\n2\tDefeat Dolpan\tDolpan was about to craft a weapon in the ancient forge when it was disabled. He must be defeated.\n",
[6845]="700375BA\n1\tTalk to Reeve Fríthild\tYou should speak with Reeve Fríthild.\n2\tObserve the festivities in the Mead Hall of Stoke\tObserve the feast in the Mead Hall of Stoke.\n3\tTalk to Thane Ordlac\tYou should speak with Thane Ordlac.\n4\tCollect mug of water\tA mug of water sits on one of the tables below the dais. Thane Ordlac instructed you to fetch a cup of water.\n5\tBring the water to Thane Ordlac\tThane Ordlac is kneeling beside Reeve Fríthild. You should bring the water to Thane Ordlac.\n",
[6846]="7001ECCE\n1\tDefeat the Gloom of Nurn\tDefeat the Gloom of Nurn and his forces before the gates of Dol Guldur.\n2\tReturn to the Stone of Challenge\t\n",
[6847]="7002825A\n1\tDefeat wights in Plas-maru (total: 5)\030Defeat the wight-captain\tDefeat the wights that have arisen within the great cairn of Plas-maru.\n",
[6848]="7005471C\n1\tWait by the flat stone for Karazgar to arrive and claim his prize\tYou have chosen to deliver the Black Book of Mordor to Karazgar, and should wait by the flat stone in the Old Ford until he arrives to claim his prize.\n2\tRemain on your guard\tKarazgar has come to meet with you at the Old Ford.\n3\tTalk to Karazgar at the Old Ford\tKarazgar has come to meet with you at the Old Ford.\n4\tAnswer Karazgar\tKarazgar has asked you a question, and awaits your response.\n5\tTalk to Karazgar at the Old Ford\tKarazgar has come to meet with you at the Old Ford.\n6\tGive Karazgar your conditions\tKarazgar waits to hear your conditions.\n7\tPlace the Black Book of Mordor on the flat stone\tKarazgar has agreed to your conditions, and waits for you to set the Black Book on the flat stone.\n8\tRemain on your guard\tKarazgar has taken the Black Book of Mordor.\n",
